#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:44
msgid "1. Introduction, syntax, data types and variables"
msgstr "1. Въведение, синтаксис, типове данни и променливи"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:46
msgid "Python next to SQL and SAS: what each one is used for."
msgstr "Python до SQL и SAS: за какво се използва всеки от тях."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:47
msgid "Working with VS Code and Jupyter notebooks."
msgstr "Работа с VS Code и Jupyter notebooks."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:48
msgid "`int`, `float`, `str`, `bool`, `None`; converting between types; operators."
msgstr "`int`, `float`, `str`, `bool`, `None`; преобразуване между типове; оператори."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:49
msgid "f-strings; `Decimal` for money values."
msgstr "f-strings; `Decimal` за парични стойности."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:51
msgid "2. Conditional statements and loops"
msgstr "2. Условни конструкции и loops"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:53
msgid "`if` / `elif` / `else`, logical operators, `match`."
msgstr "`if` / `elif` / `else`, логически оператори, `match`."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:55
msgid "The Python version of `CASE WHEN` and of the loops in a DATA step."
msgstr "Версията на Python за `CASE WHEN` и за loops в DATA step."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:56
msgid "Tasks: sorting clients into risk classes."
msgstr "Задачи: разпределяне на клиенти по рискови класове."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:58
msgid "3. Lists (basics), tuples and sets"
msgstr "3. Lists (основи), tuples и sets"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:60
msgid "Creating lists, indexing, slicing, the methods of `list`."
msgstr "Създаване на lists, индексиране, slicing, методите на `list`."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:61
msgid "Tuples as records that cannot change."
msgstr "Tuples като записи, които не могат да се променят."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:62
msgid "Sets for unique values, and set operations like `UNION` / `INTERSECT` / `EXCEPT`."
msgstr "Sets за уникални стойности и операции със sets като `UNION` / `INTERSECT` / `EXCEPT`."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:64
msgid "4. Functions"
msgstr "4. Функции"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:66
msgid "`def`, parameters and default values, `*args` / `**kwargs`, `return`."
msgstr "`def`, параметри и стойности по подразбиране, `*args` / `**kwargs`, `return`."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:67
msgid "Scope of variables, docstrings, type hints, `lambda`."
msgstr "Scope на променливите, docstrings, type hints, `lambda`."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:68
msgid "Functions instead of SAS macros."
msgstr "Функции вместо SAS макроси."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:70
msgid "5. Lists (advanced)"
msgstr "5. Lists (за напреднали)"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:72
msgid "List comprehensions; `sorted` with `key`; `min` / `max`."
msgstr "List comprehensions; `sorted` с `key`; `min` / `max`."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:74
msgid "Nested lists: a table as a list of rows; copies and references."
msgstr "Вложени lists: таблица като list от редове; копия и референции."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:76
msgid "6. Dictionaries"
msgstr "6. Dictionaries"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:78
msgid "Working with `dict`, looping over it, nested dictionaries, dict comprehensions."
msgstr "Работа с `dict`, обхождане с loop, вложени dictionaries, dict comprehensions."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:80
msgid "Grouping and aggregating by hand (`GROUP BY` without pandas)."
msgstr "Групиране и агрегиране на ръка (`GROUP BY` без pandas)."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:81
msgid "Lookup tables and nomenclatures."
msgstr "Таблици за търсене (lookup tables) и номенклатури."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:83
msgid "7. Text processing"
msgstr "7. Обработка на текст"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:85
msgid "The methods of `str`: `split` / `join`, `strip`, `replace`, formatting."
msgstr "Методите на `str`: `split` / `join`, `strip`, `replace`, форматиране."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:86
msgid "Cleaning text data: names, codes, identifiers."
msgstr "Почистване на текстови данни: имена, кодове, идентификатори."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:87
msgid "Dates from text with `datetime`."
msgstr "Дати от текст с `datetime`."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:89
msgid "8. Regular expressions"
msgstr "8. Регулярни изрази (regular expressions)"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:91
msgid "The `re` module: patterns, groups, `search` / `findall` / `sub` / `split`."
msgstr "Модулът `re`: patterns, groups, `search` / `findall` / `sub` / `split`."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:92
msgid "Validating IBANs, company ids (EIK), e-mails and dates; extracting values from free text."
msgstr "Валидиране на IBAN, ЕИК, e-mail адреси и дати; извличане на стойности от свободен текст."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:94
msgid "The Python version of `PRXMATCH` (SAS) and `LIKE` / `REGEXP` (SQL)."
msgstr "Версията на Python за `PRXMATCH` (SAS) и `LIKE` / `REGEXP` (SQL)."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:96
msgid "9. Error handling and file handling"
msgstr "9. Обработка на грешки и работа с файлове"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:98
msgid "`try` / `except` / `else` / `finally`, kinds of exceptions, `raise`, your own exceptions."
msgstr "`try` / `except` / `else` / `finally`, видове exceptions, `raise`, ваши собствени exceptions."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:100
msgid "`pathlib`, `with open`; text, CSV, JSON and Excel files."
msgstr "`pathlib`, `with open`; текстови, CSV, JSON и Excel файлове."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:101
msgid "Handling bad records while loading data."
msgstr "Обработка на лоши записи при зареждане на данни."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:103
msgid "10. Modules, packages, Git and GitHub"
msgstr "10. Модули, пакети, Git и GitHub"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:105
msgid "`import`, your own modules, the standard library (`datetime`, `collections`, `statistics`, `os`)."
msgstr "`import`, ваши собствени модули, стандартната библиотека (`datetime`, `collections`, `statistics`, `os`)."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:107
msgid "`pip` and virtual environments; the structure of a project."
msgstr "`pip` и виртуални среди; структурата на един проект."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:108
msgid "Git: `commit`, `branch`, `merge`, `.gitignore`. GitHub: `clone`, `push`, `pull`, pull requests."
msgstr "Git: `commit`, `branch`, `merge`, `.gitignore`. GitHub: `clone`, `push`, `pull`, pull requests."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:111
msgid "11. OOP: first steps, classes and objects"
msgstr "11. ООП: първи стъпки, класове и обекти"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:113
msgid "Class and object, `__init__`, attributes, methods, `self`."
msgstr "Клас и обект, `__init__`, атрибути, методи, `self`."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:114
msgid "`__str__` / `__repr__`; class attributes; `property`; dataclasses."
msgstr "`__str__` / `__repr__`; атрибути на класа; `property`; dataclasses."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:116
msgid "12. OOP in practice: nomenclatures"
msgstr "12. ООП на практика: номенклатури"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:118
msgid "A nomenclature as a class: data, metadata, validation rules and processing methods."
msgstr "Номенклатура като клас: данни, метаданни, правила за валидиране и методи за обработка."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:120
msgid "`classmethod` and `staticmethod`; inheritance and composition."
msgstr "`classmethod` и `staticmethod`; наследяване и композиция."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:121
msgid "Applying one nomenclature the same way to different datasets."
msgstr "Прилагане на една номенклатура по един и същи начин към различни набори от данни."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:123
msgid "13. Working with databases"
msgstr "13. Работа с бази данни"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:125
msgid "DB-API and `sqlite3`: connection, cursor, parameterised queries, transactions."
msgstr "DB-API и `sqlite3`: връзка (connection), cursor, параметризирани заявки, транзакции."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:126
msgid "SQLAlchemy engine; the result of a query straight into a DataFrame."
msgstr "SQLAlchemy engine; резултатът от заявка направо в DataFrame."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:127
msgid "Drivers for Oracle / MS SQL / PostgreSQL (overview)."
msgstr "Драйвери за Oracle / MS SQL / PostgreSQL (преглед)."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:129
msgid "14. NumPy and introduction to pandas"
msgstr "14. NumPy и въведение в pandas"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:131
msgid "`ndarray`, vector operations, broadcasting, aggregates, `np.where`."
msgstr "`ndarray`, векторни операции, broadcasting, агрегати, `np.where`."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:132
msgid "`Series` and `DataFrame`; reading CSV and Excel files."
msgstr "`Series` и `DataFrame`; четене на CSV и Excel файлове."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:133
msgid "`head`, `info`, `describe`, the types of the columns."
msgstr "`head`, `info`, `describe`, типовете на колоните."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:135
msgid "15. pandas: selection, aggregation, joins"
msgstr "15. pandas: селекция, агрегиране, съединяване (joins)"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:137
msgid "`loc` / `iloc`, boolean masks, `query`, new columns."
msgstr "`loc` / `iloc`, булеви маски, `query`, нови колони."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:138
msgid "`groupby` / `agg` (like `GROUP BY` and `PROC MEANS`)."
msgstr "`groupby` / `agg` (като `GROUP BY` и `PROC MEANS`)."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:139
msgid "`merge` / `concat` (like `JOIN` and `MERGE` in a DATA step); missing values."
msgstr "`merge` / `concat` (като `JOIN` и `MERGE` в DATA step); липсващи стойности."

#. heading 3
#: site/agenda.md:141
msgid "16. pandas: reports and final project"
msgstr "16. pandas: отчети и финален проект"

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:143
msgid "`pivot_table`, `melt`, dates and time series, export to Excel with several sheets."
msgstr "`pivot_table`, `melt`, дати и времеви редове, експорт в Excel с няколко листа."

#. paragraph
#: site/agenda.md:145
msgid "[Final project](/project): load data from a file and a database, nomenclatures as classes, cleaning, aggregation and a finished report."
msgstr "[Финален проект](/project): зареждане на данни от файл и от база данни, номенклатури като класове, почистване, агрегиране и готов отчет."

